Would you like me to guide you through the application process?`;const B=["I can help you with loan information, eligibility checks, and application guidance. What specific information are you looking for?","As your banking assistant, I can provide details on personal loans, home loans, business loans, and more. How may I assist you?","Would you like to know about our loan products, interest rates, or start an application?",`I specialize in loan guidance. You can ask me about:
• Loan types and interest rates
