 loan amount I can get?",answer:"EkPaisa offers personal loans ranging from ₹50,000 up to ₹99 Lakhs based on your income, credit score, and repayment capacity. Higher loan amounts require stronger credit profiles and income documentation."},{question:"How is EkPaisa different from banks?",answer:"Unlike individual banks, EkPaisa is a loan marketplace that compares offers from 25+ banks and NBFCs instantly. You get the best interest rates, higher approval chances, and dedicated support throughout the process - all for free."},{question:"Will checking my eligibility affect my credit score?",answer:"No, checking your eligibility on EkPaisa performs a soft inquiry that does not impact your credit score. Only when you formally apply with a lender, a hard inquiry is made."},{question:"What are the prepayment charges?",answer:"Most lenders on our platform allow prepayment after 6 EMIs with zero to minimal charges (0-4% on outstanding). Some banks offer completely foreclosure-free loans after 12 months."},{question:"Can I get a loan with low credit score?",answer:"Yes, EkPaisa works with specialized NBFCs that offer loans for credit scores as low as 650. Interest rates may be slightly higher, but we ensure you get the best available offer for your profile."},{question:"Is there any fee for using EkPaisa?",answer:"No, EkPaisa services are completely free for customers. We earn a commission from lenders, so you pay nothing extra. The interest rate you see is exactly what you get."}],O=[{name:"HDFC Bank",domain:"hdfcbank.com"},{name:"ICICI Bank",domain:"icicibank.com"},{name:"Axis Bank",domain:"axisbank.com"},{name:"SBI",domain:"sbi.co.in"},{name:"Kotak Mahindra Bank",domain:"kotak.com"},{name:"Bajaj Finserv",domain:"bajajfinserv.in"},{name:"Tata Capital",domain:"tatacapital.com"},{name:"Yes Bank",domain:"yesbank.in"},{name:"Aditya Birla Capital",domain:"adityabirlacapital.com"},{name:"Cholamandalam",domain:"chola.money"}],V=Y=>{const{name:se,value:le,type:Ne,checked:be}=Y.tar